# es\mars\lowergarden\enc_lowergarden_portal3.es
#
# The lower garden in the Hypogeum strike: four Vex ambushes and a Vex
# cloud, each its own archetype encounter that goes in as players walk into
# its volume.
#
# From one 2.3.1 run, which ran these five beside a wave fight of its own
# TU0 does not have (the gate, its door and the waves).

@activity_bundle("enc_lowergarden_portal3")

ambush_encounter smp_lower1
ambush_encounter smp_lower2
ambush_encounter smp_lower3
ambush_encounter smp_lower4
dropship_encounter vexcloud_lowgarden
